Q: How do you manage multiple if statements? A: <p>Some of your <code>if</code> cases can be merged. E.g. the snippet...</p>
<pre class="lang-cs prettyprint-override"><code>if (Raylib.GetGamepadAxisMovement(0, GamepadAxis.LeftX) &lt; 0) 
    movementV.X *= movementS;

if (Raylib.GetGamepadAxisMovement(0, GamepadAxis.LeftX) &gt; 0) 
    movementV.X *= movementS;
</code></pre>
<p>...could be shortend to:</p>
<pre class="lang-cs prettyprint-override"><code>if (Raylib.GetGamepadAxisMovement(0, GamepadAxis.LeftX) != 0) 
    movementV.X *= movementS;
</code></pre>
